3. Brief facts of the case are as follows:
On 17.11.2015 at about 5.00 p.m. when the petitioner was walking near Sankanahalli Cross, Holenarasipura - Arkalagudu Road, a Tractor bearing NC: 2023:KHC:29381 registration No.KA-13/TB-2290, being driven in a rash and negligent manner and duly insured with respondent No.2- Insurance Company came and dashed against the petitioner, because of which, he sustained the following injuries:
(a) Blunt injury abdomen with contusion of abdomen with abrasion over left Hymochondrum;
(b) Splenic injury with left renal pedicle injury with massive haemoperotonium;
(c) Massive pneumothorax right side with midline shift and (d) Lung contusion with atechectaris of left lower lobe; the injuries have resulted in removal a kidney and spleen.
